WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:16.800
It is time to recognize that while you thought the enemy was the immigrant or you thought the enemy was the trans person or you thought that the enemy was the black folk, it is not any of those people on the list. It is the old white Nepo baby that is sitting in the White House.

00:17.420 --> 00:22.540
Chicago is taking up arms over the weekend. This windy city looked like Fort Sumter.

